{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1441.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"5f5bf64e98ae8a7b169e5bf7b17f8dba024565054bb283dd552c6bc361ba98c6","ja":"「あいつに負けて君を奪われたオレは……\nやっと気づけたんだ！　君が大切な存在だって！」","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1441.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"209fd82af12da5b8d8e63b53097a64d774aefec3c653a64b545a0e593c9b4db4","ja":"「だからオレは、あいつに勝たなきゃ\nいけないんだ！　君を取り戻すために！」","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1441.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"6f941b2bb857bc6f4809deedb974bd7c03d87e70ffd2e578ffe6fe627ce81a52","ja":"「い……今更気づいたところで、もう遅い！\nこの子を悲しませた時点で、貴様には失望している！」","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1441.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"16fb3d9905298e303b3b02f37a8f921b4541b77e79462626ed7c7afae3c4e20d","ja":"「貴様には勝利も彼女も絶対に渡さん！\n何度立ち上がっても無駄だと教えてやろう！」","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1441.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"c785652b5ea8a1d12c4021387df42b6a6dcfed19ff4b4364ac3a4a452332fb1d","ja":"「俺は変わったんだ！　もう迷わない！\nお前に勝って、今度こそ彼女に優勝を……！」","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1441.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"7fb56db111a2895e94a96a15fa7ace38eed155ccd9f158dd10a8c07e452cff53","ja":"さっきのエチュード、すっげー面白かったな♪\nまさかあんな展開になっちまうなんて！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
